{"slug":"hiragana_ex","title":"平假名练习","section":"日语书写系统","html":" <h2 id=\"part1\">平假名表填空</h2><p>虽然网上有很多学习平假名的资源，但我想为了指南的完整性，还是也做一点练习。表中已经把废弃的假名去掉了（因为你用不着了解），建议你同时也用纸笔进行练习。</p><div id=\"exercise1\"><table class=\"table table-condensed\"><caption>平假名表</caption><tbody><tr><th>n</th><th>w</th><th>r</th><th>y</th><th>m</th><th>h</th><th>n</th><th>t</th><th>s</th><th>k</th><th>&nbsp;</th><th>&nbsp;</th></tr><tr><td><span class=\"hidex\" id=\"n\">ん</span><br><span class=\"small\"><a data-flip=\"n\" href=\"#\">flip</a></span></td><td><span class=\"hidex\" id=\"wa\">わ</span><br><span class=\"small\"><a data-flip=\"wa\" href=\"#\">flip</a></span></td><td><span class=\"hidex\" id=\"ra\">ら</span><br><span class=\"small\"><a data-flip=\"ra\" href=\"#\">flip</a></span></td><td><span class=\"hidex\" id=\"ya\">や</span><br><span class=\"small\"><a data-flip=\"ya\" href=\"#\">flip</a></span></td><td><span class=\"hidex\" id=\"ma\">ま</span><br><span class=\"small\"><a data-flip=\"ma\" href=\"#\">flip</a></span></td><td><span class=\"hidex\" id=\"ha\">は</span><br><span class=\"small\"><a data-flip=\"ha\" href=\"#\">flip</a></span></td><td><span class=\"hidex\" id=\"na\">な</span><br><span class=\"small\"><a data-flip=\"na\" href=\"#\">flip</a></span></td><td><span class=\"hidex\" id=\"ta\">た</span><br><span class=\"small\"><a data-flip=\"ta\" href=\"#\">flip</a></span></td><td><span class=\"hidex\" id=\"sa\">さ</span><br><span class=\"small\"><a data-flip=\"sa\" href=\"#\">flip</a></span></td><td><span class=\"hidex\" id=\"ka\">か</span><br><span class=\"small\"><a data-flip=\"ka\" href=\"#\">flip</a></span></td><td><span class=\"hidex\" id=\"a\">あ</span><br><span class=\"small\"><a data-flip=\"a\" href=\"#\">flip</a></span></td><th>a</th></tr><tr><td class=\"empty\">&nbsp;</td><td class=\"empty\">&nbsp;</td><td><span class=\"hidex\" id=\"ri\">り</span><br><span class=\"small\"><a data-flip=\"ri\" href=\"#\">flip</a></span></td><td class=\"empty\">&nbsp;</td><td><span class=\"hidex\" id=\"mi\">み</span><br><span class=\"small\"><a data-flip=\"mi\" href=\"#\">flip</a></span></td><td><span class=\"hidex\" id=\"hi\">ひ</span><br><span class=\"small\"><a data-flip=\"hi\" href=\"#\">flip</a></span></td><td><span class=\"hidex\" id=\"ni\">に</span><br><span class=\"small\"><a data-flip=\"ni\" href=\"#\">flip</a></span></td><td><span class=\"hidex\" id=\"ti\">ち</span><br><span class=\"small\"><a data-flip=\"ti\" href=\"#\">flip</a></span></td><td><span class=\"hidex\" id=\"si\">し</span><br><span class=\"small\"><a data-flip=\"si\" href=\"#\">flip</a></span></td><td><span class=\"hidex\" id=\"ki\">き</span><br><span class=\"small\"><a data-flip=\"ki\" href=\"#\">flip</a></span></td><td><span class=\"hidex\" id=\"i\">い</span><br><span class=\"small\"><a data-flip=\"i\" href=\"#\">flip</a></span></td><th>i</th></tr><tr><td class=\"empty\">&nbsp;</td><td class=\"empty\">&nbsp;</td><td><span class=\"hidex\" id=\"ru\">る</span><br><span class=\"small\"><a data-flip=\"ru\" href=\"#\">flip</a></span></td><td><span class=\"hidex\" id=\"yu\">ゆ</span><br><span class=\"small\"><a data-flip=\"yu\" href=\"#\">flip</a></span></td><td><span class=\"hidex\" id=\"mu\">む</span><br><span class=\"small\"><a data-flip=\"mu\" href=\"#\">flip</a></span></td><td><span class=\"hidex\" id=\"fu\">ふ</span><br><span class=\"small\"><a data-flip=\"fu\" href=\"#\">flip</a></span></td><td><span class=\"hidex\" id=\"nu\">ぬ</span><br><span class=\"small\"><a data-flip=\"nu\" href=\"#\">flip</a></span></td><td><span class=\"hidex\" id=\"tu\">つ</span><br><span class=\"small\"><a data-flip=\"tu\" href=\"#\">flip</a></span></td><td><span class=\"hidex\" id=\"su\">す</span><br><span class=\"small\"><a data-flip=\"su\" href=\"#\">flip</a></span></td><td><span class=\"hidex\" id=\"ku\">く</span><br><span class=\"small\"><a data-flip=\"ku\" href=\"#\">flip</a></span></td><td><span class=\"hidex\" id=\"u\">う</span><br><span class=\"small\"><a data-flip=\"u\" href=\"#\">flip</a></span></td><th>u</th></tr><tr><td class=\"empty\">&nbsp;</td><td class=\"empty\">&nbsp;</td><td><span class=\"hidex\" id=\"re\">れ</span><br><span class=\"small\"><a data-flip=\"re\" href=\"#\">flip</a></span></td><td class=\"empty\">&nbsp;</td><td><span class=\"hidex\" id=\"me\">め</span><br><span class=\"small\"><a data-flip=\"me\" href=\"#\">flip</a></span></td><td><span class=\"hidex\" id=\"he\">へ</span><br><span class=\"small\"><a data-flip=\"he\" href=\"#\">flip</a></span></td><td><span class=\"hidex\" id=\"ne\">ね</span><br><span class=\"small\"><a data-flip=\"ne\" href=\"#\">flip</a></span></td><td><span class=\"hidex\" id=\"te\">て</span><br><span class=\"small\"><a data-flip=\"te\" href=\"#\">flip</a></span></td><td><span class=\"hidex\" id=\"se\">せ</span><br><span class=\"small\"><a data-flip=\"se\" href=\"#\">flip</a></span></td><td><span class=\"hidex\" id=\"ke\">け</span><br><span class=\"small\"><a data-flip=\"ke\" href=\"#\">flip</a></span></td><td><span class=\"hidex\" id=\"e\">え</span><br><span class=\"small\"><a data-flip=\"e\" href=\"#\">flip</a></span></td><th>e</th></tr><tr><td class=\"empty\">&nbsp;</td><td><span class=\"hidex\" id=\"wo\">を</span><br><span class=\"small\"><a data-flip=\"wo\" href=\"#\">flip</a></span></td><td><span class=\"hidex\" id=\"ro\">ろ</span><br><span class=\"small\"><a data-flip=\"ro\" href=\"#\">flip</a></span></td><td><span class=\"hidex\" id=\"yo\">よ</span><br><span class=\"small\"><a data-flip=\"yo\" href=\"#\">flip</a></span></td><td><span class=\"hidex\" id=\"mo\">も</span><br><span class=\"small\"><a data-flip=\"mo\" href=\"#\">flip</a></span></td><td><span class=\"hidex\" id=\"ho\">ほ</span><br><span class=\"small\"><a data-flip=\"ho\" href=\"#\">flip</a></span></td><td><span class=\"hidex\" id=\"no\">の</span><br><span class=\"small\"><a data-flip=\"no\" href=\"#\">flip</a></span></td><td><span class=\"hidex\" id=\"to\">と</span><br><span class=\"small\"><a data-flip=\"to\" href=\"#\">flip</a></span></td><td><span class=\"hidex\" id=\"so\">そ</span><br><span class=\"small\"><a data-flip=\"so\" href=\"#\">flip</a></span></td><td><span class=\"hidex\" id=\"ko\">こ</span><br><span class=\"small\"><a data-flip=\"ko\" href=\"#\">flip</a></span></td><td><span class=\"hidex\" id=\"o\">お</span><br><span class=\"small\"><a data-flip=\"o\" href=\"#\">flip</a></span></td><th>o</th></tr></tbody></table></div><p></p><div class=\"sumbox\"><a data-reveal=\"exercise1\" href=\"#\">显示答案</a> | <a data-reveal=\"exercise1\" href=\"#\">隐藏答案</a></div><h2 id=\"part2\">平假名书写练习</h2><p>在这一节里，我们联系一些平假名单词的书写。这本指南里只有这一部分是用英语字母来代表日语发音。我在每个日语假名之间加了分隔线以免产生歧义，比如 \"unyo\" 可以解读成 \"un、yo\" ，也可以是 \"u、nyo\"。不要去研究罗马字符的拼写，这仅仅是为了测试你的听觉记忆力。我打算以后把罗马字母换成音频。</p><h3>平假名书写练习一</h3><p><b>例：</b> ta | be | mo | no ＝ <u>たべもの</u></p><div id=\"exercise2\"><table class=\"table table-condensed\"><tbody><tr><td>1. ku | ru | ma</td><td>＝</td><td class=\"answerline\"><span class=\"hidex\">くるま</span></td></tr><tr><td>2. a | shi | ta</td><td>＝</td><td class=\"answerline\"><span class=\"hidex\">あした</span></td></tr><tr><td>3. ko | ku | se | ki</td><td>＝</td><td class=\"answerline\"><span class=\"hidex\">こくせき</span></td></tr><tr><td>4. o | su | shi</td><td>＝</td><td class=\"answerline\"><span class=\"hidex\">おすし</span></td></tr><tr><td>5. ta | be | ru</td><td>＝</td><td class=\"answerline\"><span class=\"hidex\">たべる</span></td></tr><tr><td>6. wa | ka | ra | na | i</td><td>＝</td><td class=\"answerline\"><span class=\"hidex\">わからない</span></td></tr><tr><td>7. sa | zu | ke | ru</td><td>＝</td><td class=\"answerline\"><span class=\"hidex\">さずける</span></td></tr><tr><td>8. ri | ku | tsu</td><td>＝</td><td class=\"answerline\"><span class=\"hidex\">りくつ</span></td></tr><tr><td>9. ta | chi | yo | mi</td><td>＝</td><td class=\"answerline\"><span class=\"hidex\">たちよみ</span></td></tr><tr><td>10. mo | no | ma | ne</td><td>＝</td><td class=\"answerline\"><span class=\"hidex\">ものまね</span></td></tr><tr><td>11. hi | ga | e | ri</td><td>＝</td><td class=\"answerline\"><span class=\"hidex\">ひがえり</span></td></tr><tr><td>12. pon | zu</td><td>＝</td><td class=\"answerline\"><span class=\"hidex\">ぽんず</span></td></tr><tr><td>13. hi | ru | me | shi</td><td>＝</td><td class=\"answerline\"><span class=\"hidex\">ひるめし</span></td></tr><tr><td>14. re | ki | shi</td><td>＝</td><td class=\"answerline\"><span class=\"hidex\">れきし</span></td></tr><tr><td>15. fu | yu | ka | i</td><td>＝</td><td class=\"answerline\"><span class=\"hidex\">ふゆかい</span></td></tr></tbody></table><div class=\"sumbox\"><a data-reveal=\"exercise2\" href=\"#\">切换显示答案</a></div></div><h2 id=\"part3\">更多平假名书写练习</h2><p>现在我们要练习书写带有小「や」、「ゆ」、「よ」 、的平假名，以及长元音。我会把长元音用－标出，然后由你回答该用哪个假名来拉长发音。</p><h3>平假名书写练习二</h3><p><b>例：</b> jyu | gyo－ ＝ <u>じゅぎょう</u></p><div id=\"exercise3\"><table class=\"large\" cellspacing=\"8\"><tbody><tr><td>1. nu | ru | i | o | cha</td><td>＝</td><td class=\"answerline\"><span class=\"hidex\">ぬるいおちゃ</span></td></tr><tr><td>2. kyu－ | kyo | ku</td><td>＝</td><td class=\"answerline\"><span class=\"hidex\">きゅうきょく</span></td></tr><tr><td>3. un | yo－| jyo－ | ho－</td><td>＝</td><td class=\"answerline\"><span class=\"hidex\">うんようじょうほう</span></td></tr><tr><td>4. byo－ | do－</td><td>＝</td><td class=\"answerline\"><span class=\"hidex\">びょうどう</span></td></tr><tr><td>5. jyo－ | to－ | shu | dan</td><td>＝</td><td class=\"answerline\"><span class=\"hidex\">じょうとうしゅだん</span></td></tr><tr><td>6. gyu－ | nyu－</td><td>＝</td><td class=\"answerline\"><span class=\"hidex\">ぎゅうにゅう</span></td></tr><tr><td>7. sho－ | rya | ku</td><td>＝</td><td class=\"answerline\"><span class=\"hidex\">しょうりゃく</span></td></tr><tr><td>8. hya | ku | nen | ha | ya | i</td><td>＝</td><td class=\"answerline\"><span class=\"hidex\">ひゃくねんはやい</span></td></tr><tr><td>9. so | tsu | gyo－ | shi | ki</td><td>＝</td><td class=\"answerline\"><span class=\"hidex\">そつぎょうしき</span></td></tr><tr><td>10. to－ | nyo－ | byo－</td><td>＝</td><td class=\"answerline\"><span class=\"hidex\">とうにょうびょう</span></td></tr><tr><td>11. mu | ryo－</td><td>＝</td><td class=\"answerline\"><span class=\"hidex\">むりょう</span></td></tr><tr><td>12. myo－ | ji</td><td>＝</td><td class=\"answerline\"><span class=\"hidex\">みょうじ</span></td></tr><tr><td>13. o | ka－ | san</td><td>＝</td><td class=\"answerline\"><span class=\"hidex\">おかあさん</span></td></tr><tr><td>14. ro－ | nin</td><td>＝</td><td class=\"answerline\"><span class=\"hidex\">ろうにん</span></td></tr><tr><td>15. ryu－ | ga | ku | se | i</td><td>＝</td><td class=\"answerline\"><span class=\"hidex\">りゅうがくせい</span></td></tr></tbody></table><div class=\"sumbox\"><a data-reveal=\"exercise3\" href=\"#\">切换显示答案</a></div></div><h2 id=\"part4\">平假名阅读练习</h2><p>现在我们来读一些平假名。请特别注意小「つ」的发音。记住不要太纠结罗马字母的拼写，练习的目的是测试你是否记住了发音。</p><h3>平假名阅读练习</h3><p><b>例：</b> とった ＝ <u>totta</u></p><div id=\"exercise4\"><table class=\"large\" cellspacing=\"8\"><tbody><tr><td>1. きゃっかんてき</td><td>＝</td><td class=\"answerline\"><span class=\"hidex\">kyakkanteki</span></td></tr><tr><td>2. はっぴょうけっか</td><td>＝</td><td class=\"answerline\"><span class=\"hidex\">happyoukekka</span></td></tr><tr><td>3. ちょっかん</td><td>＝</td><td class=\"answerline\"><span class=\"hidex\">chokkan</span></td></tr><tr><td>4. ひっし</td><td>＝</td><td class=\"answerline\"><span class=\"hidex\">hisshi</span></td></tr><tr><td>5. ぜったい</td><td>＝</td><td class=\"answerline\"><span class=\"hidex\">zettai</span></td></tr><tr><td>6. けっちゃく</td><td>＝</td><td class=\"answerline\"><span class=\"hidex\">kecchaku</span></td></tr><tr><td>7. しっぱい</td><td>＝</td><td class=\"answerline\"><span class=\"hidex\">shippai</span></td></tr><tr><td>8. ちゅうとはんぱ</td><td>＝</td><td class=\"answerline\"><span class=\"hidex\">chuutohanpa</span></td></tr><tr><td>9. やっかい</td><td>＝</td><td class=\"answerline\"><span class=\"hidex\">yakkai</span></td></tr><tr><td>10. しょっちゅう</td><td>＝</td><td class=\"answerline\"><span class=\"hidex\">shotchuu</span></td></tr></tbody></table><div class=\"sumbox\"><a data-reveal=\"exercise4\" href=\"#\">切换显示答案</a></div></div> ","orig":"http://guidetojapanese.org/learn/grammar/hiragana_ex"}